OL,3,GNEWSACouncil will sell 100 acres of
OL,4,Afarmland for homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome of the farmland owned by Cornwall
OL,7,FCouncil will be used to build
OL,8,Faffordable housing for local people, it
OL,9,Fhas been confirmed.
OL,11,FThe council's cabinet of senior
OL,12,Fpoliticians agreed 100 acres would be
OL,13,Fused for the housing at a meeting on
OL,14,FWednesday.
OL,16,FThe decision followed a six-month
OL,17,Finquiry, which said there was no reason
OL,18,Fto sell off the entire estate of 80
OL,19,Ffarms which cover about 10,000 acres,
OL,20,Fthe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
