OL,3,GNEWSACouncil will sell 100 acres of
OL,4,Afarmland for homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt advised cutting the number of the
OL,7,Fcouncil's dairy farms and reducing the
OL,8,Fnumber of farm buildings and equipment
OL,9,Fto save money.
